  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Read Me: How to Use Logs",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Mac Logs \u2014 Quick Guide\nThis dashboard shows **system**, **app**, and **observability** logs in one place.\n\n**Best starting point**\n- Time range: **Last 1 hour**\n- job: **system**\n- log_type: **system** or **wifi**\n\n**Common searches**\n- `error`, `failed`, `panic`, `crash`\n- App names (e.g., `Chrome`, `Docker`, `Zoom`)\n\n**What each filter means**\n- **job**: system vs user vs observability\n- **log_type**: category like wifi/install/diagnostics/app\n- **filename**: exact file you want to tail\n- **search**: keyword in the log message\n\nTip: Expand a log row to see full metadata and the file path."
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Active Log Streams",
      "description": "Approximate number of active log streams ingested into Loki. If this is 0, logs are not being ingested.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "efccujve04lxca"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(count_over_time({job=~\"$job\",log_type=~\"$log_type\"}[5m]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Log Ingestion Health",
      "description": "Promtail shipping status. If this is 0, Promtail is not sending logs to Loki.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "efccujve04lxca"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(promtail_sent_bytes_total[5m]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "Bps",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Read Me: How to Use Logs",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Mac Logs \u2014 Quick Guide\nThis dashboard shows **system**, **app**, and **observability** logs in one place.\n\n**Best starting point**\n- Time range: **Last 1 hour**\n- job: **system**\n- log_type: **system** or **wifi**\n\n**Common searches**\n- `error`, `failed`, `panic`, `crash`\n- App names (e.g., `Chrome`, `Docker`, `Zoom`)\n\n**What each filter means**\n- **job**: system vs user vs observability\n- **log_type**: category like wifi/install/diagnostics/app\n- **filename**: exact file you want to tail\n- **search**: keyword in the log message\n\nTip: Expand a log row to see full metadata and the file path."
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "All Logs (Filtered)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "efccujve04lxca"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 16
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "{job=~\"$job\",log_type=~\"$log_type\",filename=~\"$filename\"}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showLabels": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "signature",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": true,
        "showCommonLabels": false
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineLimit": 500,
            "showTime": true,
            "showLabels": true
          }
        }
      },
      "description": "This view is unfiltered so it never shows \"No data\" unless Loki is down."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "System Critical (errors/warn)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "efccujve04lxca"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 33,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "{job=\"system\"} |= \"error\" or {job=\"system\"} |= \"warn\"",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showLabels": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "signature",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": true,
        "showCommonLabels": false
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineLimit": 500,
            "showTime": true,
            "showLabels": true
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
